	JMP	KBTOUT		/And try to output		/M055
KBTWAT,	JMS I	XCHKHLT		/User requested halt		/M055
	CIFSYS			/Change to system field		/M055
	JWAIT			/Hang about			/M055
KBTOUT,	TAD	KBIOCHR		/Get char back			/M055
	CIFSYS			/Change to system field		/M055
KBTXXX,	XX			/Service routine		/M055
